# Prepared by the US Dept. of Commerce, NOAA, Space Weather Prediction Cent=
er
#
#          Geophysical Alert Message
#
Solar-terrestrial indices for 03 October follow.
Solar flux 93 and estimated planetary A-index 7.
The estimated planetary K-index at 1500 UTC on 04 October was 4.67.

Space weather for the past 24 hours has been minor.
Geomagnetic storms reaching the G1 level occurred.

Space weather for the next 24 hours is predicted to be minor.
Geomagnetic storms reaching the G1 level are expected.


